Scope
-----
The MIT license applies to project-authored code, documentation, metadata,
generated trace collections and original contributions to SX encodings.
Source datasets retain their upstream licenses: ECG signals (MIT), Engine
timing model (GNU GPL version 3), and F1tenth car (CC0-1.0). These licenses are
provided in datasets/<system_id>/LICENSE and recorded in the dataset manifests.
